(wind-axis-aero)
*title Wind-axis aerodynamic coefficient set
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=10000 long=0 lat=0 vel=600 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 mass=20
  *file wind-axis.dat time mach alpha cl cd cs accebx acceby accebz
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.25 dt=0.025
    *aero cl=(test-cl) cd=(test-cd) cs=(test-cs)
    *fly alpha=5
    *fly betae=0
    *fly bankgd=0
    *when time=2 stop
*end
